<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JCI icsues notice on &quot;early-stage&quot; talks.</title>
<headline>JCI icsues notice on &quot;early-stage&quot; talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's JCI Ltd on Monday issued a cautionary notice to shareholders saying it was in &quot;early-stage&quot; talks with Lonrho Plc on a possible merger.</p>
</text>
